      "tags": [
        "guides",
        "typography"
      ],
      "daysAgo": 18,
      "markdown": "Variable fonts can move. Animate the weight axis on hover and a headline breathes.\n\n```css\nh1:hover { font-variation-settings: \"wght\" 800; transition: font-variation-settings .4s; }\n```\n\nPlaceholder guide.",
      "subtitle": "Animate the weight axis and a headline breathes.",
